WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.260
- Do you think it's crazy though?

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:03.030
Okay, you grew up in the
South and maybe from more

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:04.530
humble beginnings than, obviously, now.

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:05.900
Like, do you think it's crazy, if like...

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.140
My husband and I talk
about this all the time

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.427
with my life. Like, in my
life, in our life, we're like

00:00:08.427 --> 00:00:11.000
"Wow!", we came from like
nothing, and like, you know,

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.270
do you think about that? Like...

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:15.970
- Yeah! I come from
real humble beginnings.

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:17.000
- Me too!

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.670
- I think when I was 6 years
old, though, is when I heard

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:24.097
a voice that changed my life
forever and that was Whitney.

00:00:24.097 --> 00:00:24.930
- "Oh!"

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:27.270
- And I heard the song
"The Greatest Love of All."

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:28.620
Such an epic song.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:31.255
The lyrics are so prevalent
still today, right?

00:00:31.255 --> 00:00:32.890
- That's literally; I love hearing that!

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:34.640
What were your, kind of, beginnings?

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:35.473
- When I moved to...

00:00:35.473 --> 00:00:37.117
- You better be have been humble, Tony!

00:00:37.117 --> 00:00:38.147
(laughter)

00:00:38.147 --> 00:00:39.220
- My first...

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:41.577
- When I took the silver
spoon from my mouth...

00:00:41.577 --> 00:00:42.900
(laughing)

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:44.690
- My favorite thing to
do, is like, go to a mall.

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:48.150
Um, I-I, my first... I love a mall.

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:49.694
- I was like, did he just say mall?

00:00:49.694 --> 00:00:50.760
- It's a mall. It's a mall.

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:52.840
No, but I remember when I moved
to New York, my first show

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:55.743
was "Shakespheare in the
Park"-ing lot in the East Village.

00:00:55.743 --> 00:00:56.576
(laughing)

00:00:56.576 --> 00:00:57.960
- And we did, we did, uh...

00:00:57.960 --> 00:00:59.840
- There it is! There it is.

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:01.830
- We did, uh, I'm not kidding!

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:04.290
We did "Taming of the
Shrew" in a parking lot

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:05.744
in the East Village and I rocked it.

00:01:05.744 --> 00:01:08.920
- He said Shakespheare in the parking lot.

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:10.950
- It's not like a garage
band, that's like...

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:11.826
- No, no. We did...

00:01:11.826 --> 00:01:12.754
- Parking lot.

00:01:12.754 --> 00:01:13.587
- We did Shakespeare next to all the

00:01:13.587 --> 00:01:14.708
East Village folks.

00:01:14.708 --> 00:01:15.541
- I love that.

00:01:15.541 --> 00:01:16.374
- It was in the mid 90's.

00:01:16.374 --> 00:01:17.370
- (Kelly) Gosh! That's awesome!

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:18.553
- So, top that, Nicole!

00:01:18.553 --> 00:01:21.761
- Alright. (laughter)

